    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Solución de sistemas de ecuaciones lineales\"\ndescription: \"Ejercicios\"\nauthor: \"Eduardo Castro; Marvin Trejo\"\ndate: \"2025-08-27\"\ncategories: [Ejercicios]\n---\n\nDurante esta clase resolvimos, por el método de sustitución, igualación y gráfico, los siguientes ejercicios.\n\n## Ejercicio 1.\n\n$$\n\\begin{align}\n5x-8y &= -\\frac{64}{16} \\tag{A}\\\\\\\\\n2x+3y &= \\frac{153}{40} \\tag{B}\\\\\n\\end{align}\n$$\n\n::: panel-tabset\n### Método de sustitución\n\n1)  Despejamos para una variable, en este caso despejamos $x$ de la ecuación A $$\n    \\begin{align}\n    5x &= -\\frac{64}{16} +8y \\\\\\\\\n    5x &= -4+8y \\\\\\\\\n    x &= \\frac{8}{5}y-\\frac{4}{5} \\tag{A1} \\\\\n    \\end{align}\n    $$\n2)  Sustituimos $x$ en la ecuación B $$\n    \\begin{align}\n    2(\\frac{8}{5}y-\\frac{4}{5})+3y &= \\frac{153}{40} \\\\\\\\\n    \\frac{16}{5}y-\\frac{8}{5} +3y &= \\frac{153}{40} \\\\\\\\\n    \\frac{16}{5}y-\\frac{15}{5}y &= \\frac{153}{40} + \\frac{8}{5} \\\\\\\\\n    \\frac{31}{5}y&= \\frac{153+64}{40} = \\frac{217}{40} \\\\\\\\\n    y&= \\frac{217}{40}(\\frac{5}{31}) \\\\\\\\\n    \\end{align}\n    $$ **Tip:** Cuando trabajen con fracciones grandes, busquen siempre la manera de simplificar o reducir las operaciones que deben realizar. En este caso, para evitar la multiplicación por $\\frac{5}{31}$ podemos replantear $\\frac{217}{40}$ de la siguiente manera\n\n$$\n\\begin{align}\ny &= \\frac{(7)(\\color{blue}{31})}{(8)(\\color{green}{5})}(\\frac{\\color{green}{5}}{\\color{blue}{31}}) \\\\\n\\mathbf{y} &= \\mathbf{\\frac{7}{8}}\n\\end{align}\n$$ 3) Sustituimos el valor de $y$ en la ecuación A1 $$\n\\begin{align}\nx &= \\frac{8}{5}y-\\frac{4}{5} \\tag{A1} \\\\\\\\\nx &= \\frac{8}{5}(\\frac{7}{8})-\\frac{4}{5} \\\\\\\\\nx &= \\frac{7}{5}-\\frac{4}{5} \\\\\\\\\n\\mathbf{x} &= \\mathbf{\\frac{3}{5}}\n\\end{align}\n$$ **Solución** $$\n\\begin{align}\nx &= \\frac{3}{5} \\\\ \\\\\ny&= \\frac{7}{8}\n\\end{align}\n$$\n\n### Método de igualación\n\n1)  Despejamos una de las incógnitas en ambas ecuaciones, para este ejemplo utilizaremos $x$\n\n$$\n\\begin{align}\n5x &= -\\frac{64}{16} +8y \\\\\\\\\n5x &= -4+8y \\\\\\\\\nx &= \\frac{8}{5}y-\\frac{4}{5} \\tag{A1} \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\n\\\\\n2x &= \\frac{153}{40} -3y \\\\\\\\\nx &= (\\frac{1}{2})(\\frac{153}{40}-3y) \\\\\\\\\nx &= \\frac{153}{80} - \\frac{3}{2}y \\tag{B1} \n\\end{align}\n$$\n\n2)  Igualamos las ecuaciones A1 y B1\n\n$$\n\\begin{align}\n\\frac{8}{5}y-\\frac{4}{5} &= \\frac{153}{80} - \\frac{3}{2}y \\\\ \\\\\n\\frac{8}{5}y+\\frac{3}{2}y &= \\frac{153}{80} + \\frac{4}{5} \\\\\\\\\n\\frac{16+15}{10}y &= \\frac{765+320}{400} \\\\\\\\\n\\frac{31}{10}y &= \\frac{1085}{400} \\\\\\\\\ny &= \\frac{1085}{400} (\\frac{10}{31})=\\frac{(35)(31)}{(40)(10)} (\\frac{10}{31})  \\\\\\\\\ny &= \\frac{35}{40} = \\frac{(7)(5)}{(8)(5)}  \\\\\\\\\ny&=\\frac{7}{8}\n\\end{align}\n$$\n\n3)  Por último sustituimos el valor de $y$ en la ecuación A1 para obtener el valor de $x$\n\n$$\n\\begin{align}\nx &= \\frac{8}{5}y-\\frac{4}{5} \\tag{A1} \\\\ \\\\\nx &= \\frac{8}{5}(\\frac{7}{8})-\\frac{4}{5} \\\\ \\\\\nx &= \\frac{7}{5}-\\frac{4}{5} \\\\ \\\\\nx &= \\frac{3}{5}\n\\end{align}\n$$ **Solución**\n\n$$\n\\begin{align}\nx &= \\frac{3}{5} \n\\\\\\\\\ny&=\\frac{7}{8}\n\\end{align}\n$$\n\n### Método gráfico\n\nLa solución por método gráfico requiere que en cada recta conozcamos al menos dos puntos que nos permitan graficar, los más sencillos serían los puntos donde $x=0$ e $y=0$. En la ecuación A tenemos los siguientes puntos $$\n\\begin{align}\n5x-8y &= -\\frac{64}{16} \\tag{A}\\\\\\\\\n5(0)-8y&=-4 \\\\\\\\\ny&=\\frac{-4}{-8}=\\frac{1}{2} \\\\\\\\\nx=0; \\quad y&=\\frac{1}{2} \\tag{Punto A1} \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n5x-8(0)&=-4 \\\\\\\\\nx&=-\\frac{4}{5} \\\\\\\\\n\\quad \\quad x=-\\frac{4}{5}; \\quad y&=0 \\tag{Punto A2}\n\\end{align}\n$$ En la ecuación B tenemos los siguientes puntos $$\n\\begin{align}\n2x+3y &= \\frac{153}{40} \\tag{B}\\\\\\\\\n2(0)+3y &= \\frac{153}{40} \\\\\\\\\ny&=(\\frac{1}{3})\\frac{153}{40}= \\frac{153}{120} \\tag{Punto B1} \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n2x+3(0) &= \\frac{153}{40} \\\\\\\\\ny&=(\\frac{1}{2})\\frac{153}{40}= \\frac{153}{80} \\tag{Punto B2} \\\\\\\\\n\\end{align}\n$$\n\nEste conjunto de puntos nos permite graficar y visualizar la solución del sistema de ecuaciones.\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"highchart html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-1d977a8a83b3d505da1d\" style=\"width:100%;height:464px;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-1d977a8a83b3d505da1d\">{\"x\":{\"hc_opts\":{\"chart\":{\"reflow\":true},\"title\":{\"text\":\"Método gráfico\",\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\",\"fontWeight\":\"bold\"}},\"yAxis\":{\"title\":{\"text\":null},\"plotLines\":[{\"value\":0,\"color\":\"darkgrey\",\"width\":2,\"zIndex\":3}]},\"credits\":{\"enabled\":false},\"exporting\":{\"enabled\":false},\"boost\":{\"enabled\":false},\"plotOptions\":{\"series\":{\"label\":{\"enabled\":false},\"turboThreshold\":0,\"animation\":false,\"states\":{\"inactive\":{\"enabled\":false},\"hover\":{\"animation\":{\"duration\":0}}}},\"treemap\":{\"layoutAlgorithm\":\"squarified\"}},\"series\":[{\"group\":\"group\",\"data\":[{\"x\":-2,\"y\":-0.75},{\"x\":-1.9,\"y\":-0.6875},{\"x\":-1.8,\"y\":-0.625},{\"x\":-1.7,\"y\":-0.5625},{\"x\":-1.6,\"y\":-0.5},{\"x\":-1.5,\"y\":-0.4375},{\"x\":-1.4,\"y\":-0.375},{\"x\":-1.3,\"y\":-0.3124999999999999},{\"x\":-1.2,\"y\":-0.25},{\"x\":-1.1,\"y\":-0.1875},{\"x\":-1,\"y\":-0.125},{\"x\":-0.8999999999999999,\"y\":-0.0625},{\"x\":-0.7999999999999998,\"y\":1.110223024625157e-16},{\"x\":-0.7,\"y\":0.0625},{\"x\":-0.5999999999999999,\"y\":0.1250000000000001},{\"x\":-0.5,\"y\":0.1875},{\"x\":-0.3999999999999999,\"y\":0.2500000000000001},{\"x\":-0.2999999999999998,\"y\":0.3125000000000001},{\"x\":-0.2,\"y\":0.375},{\"x\":-0.09999999999999987,\"y\":0.4375000000000001},{\"x\":0,\"y\":0.5},{\"x\":0.1000000000000001,\"y\":0.5625},{\"x\":0.200000